n. This check used files available at run time. Do not enter picks, retry delivery, or change contest state from this alert. Before any new-day correction, verify in MLB that the prior slate's entries are settled or there was no entry. Use the new day's morning state check, when available, and live refusal for current diagnosis. Season contract status shows current files."]]]
